Manages a team and supervises the Performance Management & Development (PMD) activities for employees under his/her supervision.
Qualifications:
University degree in law, International relations, security or equivalent;
Minimum 10 -12 years of overall professional experience;
Significant professional field experience with a successful track record in managing security;
