He/she will oversee risk management geared towards managing and minimizing risk in the digital business channels.
Reporting to the Chief Executive Officer, the successful candidate will be responsible for:
Driving revenue growth through all the various digital channels and increase customer adoption of digital banking through the development and implementation of the digital strategy;
Championing the role of digital in all revenue, product and communication activities; and provide digital knowledge input into customer and proposition development;
